OL,3,GNEWSAPlay area at War Memorial Park
OL,4,Acloses for months
OL,5,
OL,6,FA busy play area has closed for at
OL,7,Fleast six months ahead of a major
OL,8,Frevamp, despite plans not being drawn
OL,9,Fup or a contractor appointed.
OL,11,FThe play area at War Memorial Park has
OL,12,Fbecome outdated, Coventry City Council
OL,13,Fsaid, and it has received funding to
OL,14,Frebuild it, replace the water feature
OL,15,Fand put a multi-use games area in its
OL,16,Fplace.
OL,18,FBut visitors have told BBC CWR they
OL,19,Fonly found out about the closure when
OL,20,Fthey arrived with children to find it
OL,21,Ffenced off with a notice stating it
OL,22,Fwill re-open in 2027.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
