OL,3,GNEWSAPlay area at War Memorial Park
OL,4,Acloses for months
OL,5,
OL,6,F"We were just very disappointed to be
OL,7,Fhonest. We realised that the kids have
OL,8,Fgone back to school but there are other
OL,9,Fchildren," Sandra Park, who was there
OL,10,Fwith her grandchildren, told BBC CWR.
